[img]https://i.ibb.co/3y8BstFj/image.png[/img]

You can opt into the 1.3 Open Beta and the Workshop should automatically update you to the 1.3 version. To see if you have the Beta version installed, check the mod version. [b]It should be 1.3.0.*[/b]
If you're having trouble updating the mod, try and unsubscribe to the mod for a minute and then re-subscribe. Steam should redownload the correct version.

[img]https://i.ibb.co/TMrcJMrf/image.png[/img]

[img]https://i.ibb.co/7x1241bq/image.png[/img]

[quote]
 [b]Glorp UI[/b] improves the User Interface of [b]Europa Universalis V[/b]. Its as shrimple as that.

 [b]Have a suggestion? Recommend it down below![/b]

 [h3] Customisable [/h3]
 [list]
  [*] [b]Customize your experience[/b] using the in game [b]Glorp UI Customization Menu[/b]! Your preferences will be saved [b]Per Save Game[/b].
  [*] Prefer another mods implementation? Simply place it [b]after Glorp UI[/b] in the load order and it will override our changes!
  [*] [b]Glorp UI[/b] is fully integrated in the [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url][/b]! Manage all of our settings from their unified [b]Mod Menu[/b]!
 [/list]

 [h3] Implemented Changes [/h3]
 [list]
  [*] [b]Colour Coded Icons[/b] - For intuitive navigation and a nice visual flair
  [*] [b]No More Leader Portrait[/b] - More space for your beautiful flag! Navigate to your dynasty/ruler via the Coat of Arms!
  [*] [b]Static Flag Option[/b] - Prefer the static flags of EU4? That's now an option! Framed and Unframed options are available.
  [*] [b]Customizable Mapmode Bar[/b] - Customize the height/width of the mapmode bar. The [b]Current Mapmode[/b] button is also in a less intrusive position.'Political' mapmode no longer appears when selected (same as Terrain).
  [*] [b]Coloured Mapmode Buttons[/b] - Added a coloured tint to the mapmode buttons based on their category for much easier usage!
  [*] [b]Redesigned Mapmode Category List[/b] - Redesigned the vanilla mapmode category list.
  [*] [b]Country Stats Panel[/b] - Toggleable country stats panel - country-wide information at a glance!
  [*] [b]Visible Societal Values Equilibrium[/b] - There is a new bar showing the maximum value of each of your societal values
  [*] [b]Toggleable Top Bar Stats[/b] - Enable and Disable the Top Bar Stats to your personal liking! Dynamic War stats hides/shows your Manpower, Sailors and War Exhaustion automatically!
  [*] [b]Redesigned Events Viewer[/b] - Redesigned the simplistic events viewer!
  [*] [b]Improved Building View[/b] - See a Location's [b]Building Limit[/b], [b]RGO[/b], and [b]Control[/b] when constructing! Includes [b]Terrain Impact[/b] for Forts! You can click the Location's Rank Icon to upgrade/downgrade the settlement!
  [*] [b]Improved Provinces Tooltip[/b] - Added RGOs and River/Coastal icons to the Province Tooltip's Location List
  [*] [b]Improved Papal Bull Tooltip[/b] - Added Papal Bull effect to the Vote Button's tooltip to save the user having to go 999 tooltips deep
  [*] [b]Zoom To Location[/b] - Pan to the location of a [b]Country's Capital[/b], an [b]Army's Location[/b], a [b]Selected Location[/b], or the [b]Capital of an International Organization[/b]! [b](Just press 'Z'!)[/b]
  [*] [b]Location View Mapmodes[/b] - Hovering over the info icons on the location view reveals the relevant mapmode.
  [*] [b]Build RGOs from Raw Goods Viewer[/b] - Simply click the RGO map icon on the Raw Materials Mapmode to open the RGO Build menu
  [*] [b]Combined Terrain Impact[/b] - Added a banner showing the combined terrain impact modifier during a battle
  [*] [b]Flashbang Be Gone[/b] - Removed the Flashbang Intro animation every time you enter a game
  [*] [b]Activate Debug Mode[/b] - Use the [b]Glorp UI Customization Menu[/b] to enable [b]Debug Mode[/b]!
  [*] [b]Miscellaneous Improvements[/b] - Alert Banner icons are larger. Outliner Category icons are larger.
 [/list]

 [h3] Recommended Mods [/h3]
 [list]
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url][/b] - Glorp UI is Fully integrated in the [b]Community Mod Framework[/b]'s Mod Menu!
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3603329466]Midnight UI[/url][/b] - UI Dark Mode
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3697317887]Zorange's Mapmode Collection[/url][/b] Adds more mapmodes!
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3696243603]Autonomous Diplomats[/url][/b] Brings back the automated diplomat system from EU4!
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3655298668]Zyrph's Flag Fixes & Additions[/url][/b] - I like flags...
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3599735023]The Idea Variation 2[/url][/b] - Adds EU4 Style National Ideas! Load Glorp UI [b]AFTER[/b] this mod in the Load Order
  [*] [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3736668860]Construction Manager[/url][/b] - Saves so many clicks (load before/above Glorp UI)
 [/list]

 [h3] Special Thanks [/h3]
 [list]
  [*] [b]EU5 Mod Coop[/b] - Without them this mod would not be possible!
  [*] [b]Conner[/b] - For single-handedly creating and maintaining Glorp UI since 1453 (very real, not fake)
  [*] [b]Mazutaki[/b] - Help with the Country Army Sizes and Tech Tree!
  [*] [b]Sol_InvictusXLII[/b] - For creating the Minesweeper Mod, which was a very useful learning tool early in development!
  [*] [b]Lord Lambert[/b] - For being Glorp UI's greatest hypeman!
  [*] [b]You[/b] - For downloading
 [/list]
[/quote]

